</TABLE>

<P STYLE="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt"><B><I>World Headquarters</I></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">358 Hall Avenue</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">Wallingford, CT 06492</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">Telephone (203) 265-8900</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><B>AMPHENOL
APPOINTS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><B><U>SANJIV LAMBA TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS</U></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">Wallingford, Connecticut. January&nbsp;8, 2026. Amphenol
Corporation (NYSE: APH) today announced that Sanjiv Lamba has been appointed to Amphenol&rsquo;s board of directors. With his appointment,
the size of the Company&rsquo;s board has increased to nine members.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">Mr.&nbsp;Lamba is currently the Chief Executive Officer
of Linde plc (NASDAQ: LIN), a leading global industrial gases and engineering company. Mr.&nbsp;Lamba is based in Danbury, Connecticut
and was promoted to the role of Chief Executive Officer of Linde in 2022 and has been named Chairman of Linde&rsquo;s board effective
January&nbsp;31, 2026. He brings nearly thirty years of global leadership experience to Amphenol&rsquo;s board. Prior to his current role
as CEO, Mr.&nbsp;Lamba served as Chief Operating Officer of Linde, where he was responsible for the regional operating segments of the
Americas, APAC and EMEA, as well as Linde Engineering, Lincare and certain other global functions. Prior to being named COO, Mr.&nbsp;Lamba
led Linde&rsquo;s operations in the Asia-Pacific region across a footprint of nearly 20 countries in the region. He joined Linde in 2006
when the company acquired BOC Group, where he served as Managing Director, Process Gas Solutions, South and Southeast Asia. Mr.&nbsp;Lamba
has been with Linde/BOC for almost his entire career, having joined BOC India in 1989. He holds a Bachelor of Commerce degree from the
University of Calcutta&rsquo;s St. Xavier&rsquo;s College, and qualified as a Chartered Accountant from the Institute of Chartered Accountants
of India.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">&ldquo;We conducted a comprehensive search for a director
who would further strengthen our board&rsquo;s breadth of talent and background, and we are delighted to have identified such an outstanding
individual,&rdquo; said Martin Loeffler, Amphenol&rsquo;s Chairman. &ldquo;I am confident that Sanjiv will make a significant contribution
to our board and the Company.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">&ldquo;Sanjiv brings a wealth of experience to Amphenol,
and we are excited to welcome him to Amphenol&rsquo;s board of directors,&rdquo; said R. Adam Norwitt, Amphenol&rsquo;s President and
CEO. &ldquo;We believe his successful track record growing and leading a high-performance multinational manufacturing business, together
with his extensive experience living and working around the world will be extremely valuable as Amphenol continues to expand internationally.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">&ldquo;I have been extremely impressed by Amphenol&rsquo;s
innovative products, dynamic leadership team and unique entrepreneurial culture, and am honored to be joining the board,&rdquo; said Mr.&nbsp;Lamba.
 &ldquo;I have tremendous respect for Martin, Adam and the entire board, and I look forward to working with them.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt"></P>

